# Scout the City {1}{G}, "Bring Down": "Destroy target creature with flying." On turn 3 Bot1 controls an Ornithopter (a flyer) and Bot2 controls an Ornithopter and a
# Memnite. The Memnite has no flying and is refused as a target; Bot2's Ornithopter is destroyed, and Bot1's own Ornithopter is a legal target too (the second
# Scout the City destroys it). Black Lotus pays the first Scout (green, one left), Mox Emerald and Mox Ruby the second.

